{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"On the table lies Mia the map. She shows a town from above, like a bird looking down.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.23,0.3],[0.36,0.78],[0.84,1.09],[1.18,1.45],[1.52,1.59],[1.67,2.15],[2.47,2.63],[2.71,3.01],[3.06,3.11],[3.19,3.53],[3.59,3.79],[3.87,4.32],[4.37,4.59],[4.63,4.66],[4.74,5.04],[5.11,5.48],[5.56,6.36]]},{"text":"Tiny pictures fill the map. Roads, houses, and parks are drawn in clear shapes.","words":[[0,0.44],[0.51,0.97],[1.06,1.3],[1.38,1.45],[1.51,1.95],[2.33,2.79],[2.84,3.32],[3.34,3.44],[3.53,3.96],[4,4.17],[4.21,4.55],[4.61,4.68],[4.76,5.06],[5.13,5.9]]},{"text":"Mia does not show every detail. Maps keep things simple so places are easy to find.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.33,0.52],[0.58,0.76],[0.84,1.16],[1.3,1.63],[1.7,2.38],[2.76,3.13],[3.22,3.46],[3.54,3.85],[3.91,4.39],[4.47,4.69],[4.79,5.22],[5.28,5.46],[5.53,5.8],[5.86,5.93],[6.03,6.87]]},{"text":"A blue line means water. A green patch means a park. Symbols help us understand quickly.","words":[[0,0.12],[0.21,0.49],[0.53,0.85],[0.89,1.18],[1.28,1.92],[2.3,2.39],[2.5,2.81],[2.89,3.24],[3.31,3.58],[3.62,3.65],[3.74,4.39],[4.77,5.24],[5.32,5.57],[5.64,5.76],[5.85,6.47],[6.55,7.38]]},{"text":"Mia helps people plan trips. She shows where places are and how to get there.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.42,0.73],[0.8,1.14],[1.2,1.5],[1.58,2.18],[2.47,2.63],[2.71,3.02],[3.06,3.29],[3.34,3.79],[3.85,4.11],[4.17,4.32],[4.4,4.56],[4.63,4.7],[4.77,4.97],[5.03,5.71]]},{"text":"Directions guide the way. Left, right, forward, and back help us move safely.","words":[[0,0.74],[0.82,1.16],[1.18,1.25],[1.32,1.76],[2.15,2.54],[2.63,3.03],[3.1,3.67],[3.71,3.84],[3.94,4.26],[4.37,4.63],[4.71,4.83],[4.92,5.18],[5.22,6.13]]},{"text":"Maps can be small or big. Some show one park, others show whole cities.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.64],[0.71,0.82],[0.88,1.37],[1.45,1.58],[1.66,2.09],[2.47,2.76],[2.81,3.08],[3.22,3.45],[3.52,4.09],[4.14,4.54],[4.6,4.88],[4.95,5.24],[5.29,6.18]]},{"text":"Emergency helpers use maps too. Maps help them reach people faster.","words":[[0,0.7],[0.78,1.21],[1.29,1.49],[1.57,1.89],[1.96,2.43],[2.88,3.2],[3.27,3.52],[3.58,3.73],[3.83,4.12],[4.2,4.59],[4.66,5.57]]},{"text":"With Mia, places make sense. We learn where we are and where we want to go.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.38,0.92],[1.13,1.56],[1.64,1.88],[1.94,2.48],[2.87,3.04],[3.13,3.47],[3.55,3.81],[3.85,3.97],[4.05,4.34],[4.41,4.56],[4.64,4.91],[4.97,5.07],[5.14,5.38],[5.42,5.49],[5.56,6.22]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: maps show places, symbols, and paths that guide us.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.28,0.89],[0.92,1.03],[1.13,1.8],[2.09,2.39],[2.42,2.62],[2.71,3.29],[3.34,3.95],[3.97,4.12],[4.23,4.63],[4.69,4.87],[4.93,5.26],[5.32,5.94]]}]}